From aded57ff1fc68f90d8c81e557b64bb0827bfa6a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code-yeongyu@noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 20:40:24 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 5681/5749] fix(shared): harden ripgrep-cli, zip-extractor,
 binary-downloader subprocess paths

Same Web-Response-on-Node hazard existed in ripgrep auto-download flow,
zip extraction helpers, and binary downloader streams. Switch to the new
Node-safe reader and ensure no spawn path escapes as unhandledRejection.

Related to #3919.

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
